y win the trick without using our best singles (A, 2), but not so high that it wastes crucial power early. This move could force the landlord to spend a high card if they want to regain control. Since our teammate passed, it’s reasonable to assume they can’t beat ♥7, so playing ♦Q helps keep pressure on landlord while conserving our strongest cards for critical moments.  \n\n**Answer:**  \n{"cards": ["♦Q"]}'}
