ntrol and run their hand.  \n\n**Reason:**  \nThe safest aggressive move is ♦A — it pressures the Landlord’s last card and likely gives control to my teammate if the Landlord cannot beat it. Playing the pair leaves me fragmented and doesn’t pressure the Landlord as much. Passing is not allowed in Free Play.  \n\n**Answer:**  \n{"cards": ["♦A"]}'}
